Third-party work
----------------

The Ogg container (pas/poaogg.pas) is written from RFC 3533.

balrogg (https://github.com/iczelia/balrogg, GPL-3.0) was studied as a
reference for what lossless Vorbis/Opus recompression can achieve. No code
from it is used, copied or translated in POA.
